WEBVTT

00:01:30.830 --> 00:01:34.490
<i>We're on Japan's highest mountain, Mt. Fuji.</i>

00:01:34.490 --> 00:01:36.490
Mountain Trail

00:01:36.690 --> 00:01:40.290
<i>Our goal is to watch the 
sunrise from the summit.</i>

00:01:40.290 --> 00:01:44.020
<i>Currently, we're headed for a mountain 
hut at the Original Eighth Station.</i>

00:01:46.620 --> 00:01:47.370
Mountain Trail

00:01:47.370 --> 00:01:48.290
Season 2 - New Climb 10

00:01:48.290 --> 00:01:50.630
Season 2 - New Climb 10
 Mt. Fuji Is Not Easy...

00:01:56.930 --> 00:01:58.930
What's up, Aoi?

00:01:58.930 --> 00:02:02.720
I was just thinking to myself, 
"I'm actually on Mt. Fuji."

00:02:02.720 --> 00:02:04.250
It feels so strange.

00:02:04.250 --> 00:02:05.430
I know what you mean.

00:02:05.430 --> 00:02:07.470
It doesn't seem real to me either.

00:02:07.470 --> 00:02:09.280
It's like I'm dreaming.

00:02:09.280 --> 00:02:12.520
Watching the sunrise from the summit 
will feel even more like a dream!

00:02:12.790 --> 00:02:13.780
Right.

00:02:19.520 --> 00:02:20.450
What?!

00:02:20.610 --> 00:02:22.700
We have to climb this?!

00:02:24.640 --> 00:02:27.500
This isn't like a trail anymore!

00:02:28.390 --> 00:02:31.610
The chain serves only as a guide! 
Be careful not to grab onto it!

00:02:31.610 --> 00:02:32.880
R-Right!

00:02:38.660 --> 00:02:41.020
<i>Maybe the air is getting thin.</i>

00:02:41.020 --> 00:02:43.510
<i>It's hard to breathe, even if I stand still.</i>

00:02:48.870 --> 00:02:53.130
<i>The Eighth Station has been 
in sight for some time.</i>

00:02:53.130 --> 00:02:55.380
<i>When will we finally get there?</i>

00:02:57.720 --> 00:02:59.430
<i>I-I'm just fine.</i>

00:02:59.430 --> 00:03:00.780
<i>I can handle this.</i>

00:03:01.410 --> 00:03:03.810
<i>Just need to walk at my own pace.</i>

00:03:03.810 --> 00:03:05.780
<i>Slowly... slowly...</i>

00:03:06.800 --> 00:03:07.800
<i>Huh?</i>

00:03:07.800 --> 00:03:09.460
<i>Why are they moving so fast?</i>

00:03:09.880 --> 00:03:11.380
<i>That's strange.</i>

00:03:12.460 --> 00:03:12.960
World Heritage

00:03:13.130 --> 00:03:13.710
Toyo Inn

00:03:14.310 --> 00:03:16.540
<i>My head aches...</i>

00:03:16.540 --> 00:03:19.210
<i>What's happening to me?</i>

00:03:21.100 --> 00:03:22.890
<i>They're talking at me...</i>

00:03:22.890 --> 00:03:24.230
<i>but I can't hear them.</i>

00:03:24.710 --> 00:03:26.560
<i>What are they saying?</i>

00:03:26.710 --> 00:03:29.600
Aoi! Don't overdo it!

00:03:29.600 --> 00:03:31.810
You can go nice and slowly!

00:03:33.470 --> 00:03:35.910
I've gotta admit, this <i>is</i> exhausting.

00:03:35.910 --> 00:03:37.950
I thought it'd be easy.

00:03:37.950 --> 00:03:40.450
You're right. It's tough.

00:03:42.520 --> 00:03:44.450
<i>My head hurts...</i>

00:03:44.830 --> 00:03:47.290
<i>I feel really tired for some reason...</i>

00:03:47.290 --> 00:03:48.620
<i>What do I do?</i>

00:03:49.220 --> 00:03:51.320
Aoi-chan, are you all right?

00:03:51.320 --> 00:03:52.120
Yeah...

00:03:53.160 --> 00:03:55.730
We're almost to the Eighth Station.

00:03:55.730 --> 00:03:57.920
Just one more push. Okay?

00:04:02.340 --> 00:04:05.220
This is the Eighth Station 

00:04:03.650 --> 00:04:05.220
Before the Ninth Station,

00:04:05.230 --> 00:04:08.010
there's the Eighth Station and 
the Original Eighth Station.

00:04:08.250 --> 00:04:10.400
Aoi, want some brown sugar puffs?

00:04:10.400 --> 00:04:12.720
Oh! I have brown sugar candy too.

00:04:12.720 --> 00:04:16.020
There's also sweet bean jelly and green tea!

00:04:16.020 --> 00:04:17.980
Am I an old man, or what?!

00:04:19.890 --> 00:04:20.900
Aoi...

00:04:21.290 --> 00:04:23.350
I got my cane branded!

00:04:23.350 --> 00:04:24.820
Along with yours, Aoi.

00:04:24.820 --> 00:04:29.580
Eighth Station - Crown Prince Inn
Elevation 3100 m

00:04:25.130 --> 00:04:28.440
They say that Crown Prince Shoutoku 
once visited this mountain hut!

00:04:28.760 --> 00:04:29.580
Wow!

00:04:29.830 --> 00:04:31.500
That's over a thousand years ago!

00:04:31.910 --> 00:04:36.210
It's said that Prince Shoutoku 
rode here on a flying horse!

00:04:36.210 --> 00:04:38.170
Whoa, that's some prince!

00:04:38.170 --> 00:04:40.380
You hear that, Aoi? He flew here on a horse!

00:04:40.800 --> 00:04:43.720
They also say that kettle was 
put there two hundred years ago.

00:04:43.720 --> 00:04:46.030
Two hundred years ago? In the Edo period?!

00:04:46.030 --> 00:04:48.050
Isn't that amazing, Aoi?!

00:04:48.050 --> 00:04:52.930
Elevation 3100 m - Crown Prince Inn

00:04:49.750 --> 00:04:52.930
Hinata-chan, Kokona-chan, come with me.

00:04:55.330 --> 00:05:00.040
You two, go on ahead of us to the reserved 
mountain hut at the Original Eighth Station.

00:05:00.040 --> 00:05:01.150
You mean...

00:05:01.150 --> 00:05:02.530
Aoi-san...

00:05:03.010 --> 00:05:04.780
She may have altitude sickness.

00:05:06.000 --> 00:05:08.070
We'll wait here for a while.

00:05:08.070 --> 00:05:10.320
If she feels better, we'll catch up with you.

00:05:15.100 --> 00:05:17.590
Aoi-san, we're going on ahead of you.

00:05:17.590 --> 00:05:19.610
Join us after you have a nice rest.

00:05:20.020 --> 00:05:20.670
Have this.

00:05:21.060 --> 00:05:22.040
It's good.

00:05:22.420 --> 00:05:23.670
Sweet Bean Jelly

00:05:23.970 --> 00:05:25.520
See you later, Kaede-san.

00:05:25.520 --> 00:05:26.880
Be careful, you two.

00:05:26.880 --> 00:05:27.380
Right!

00:05:27.380 --> 00:05:28.050
Yes!

00:05:30.710 --> 00:05:32.780
It's just the two of us now.

00:05:33.100 --> 00:05:33.930
Yeah...

00:05:34.710 --> 00:05:38.120
<i>Aoi was so excited about doing this, too.</i>

00:05:39.070 --> 00:05:41.920
<i>No... right now I've gotta focus on climbing.</i>

00:05:41.920 --> 00:05:43.830
<i>Mulling it over won't help.</i>

00:05:43.830 --> 00:05:46.730
<i>Right now, I have to do 
what I can, as best I can.</i>

00:05:46.730 --> 00:05:48.000
Hinata-san...

00:05:48.710 --> 00:05:50.760
Aoi will be a-okay!

00:05:50.760 --> 00:05:52.550
We'll just wait at the Original Eighth Station!

00:05:52.550 --> 00:05:53.450
Right!

00:05:59.210 --> 00:06:01.000
Are you all right, Aoi-chan?

00:06:01.000 --> 00:06:02.410
Would you like some water?

00:06:02.410 --> 00:06:04.210
No...

00:06:04.610 --> 00:06:06.800
<i>I've got a really bad headache.</i>

00:06:08.610 --> 00:06:12.260
Hinata-chan and Kokona-chan headed up already.

00:06:13.840 --> 00:06:16.540
We can rest at this mountain hut.

00:06:17.300 --> 00:06:19.140
Do you want to go in and lie down?

00:06:19.940 --> 00:06:22.610
<i>Hinata and Kokona-chan left...</i>

00:06:23.130 --> 00:06:24.320
<i>What'll I do?</i>

00:06:24.320 --> 00:06:26.320
<i>It's all gone wrong.</i>

00:06:26.680 --> 00:06:29.150
<i>Why did this have to happen?</i>

00:06:31.220 --> 00:06:33.240
It's pretty rough.

00:06:33.240 --> 00:06:34.490
Yes...

00:06:34.840 --> 00:06:36.710
<i>We're just walking,</i>

00:06:36.710 --> 00:06:39.230
<i>but I'm out of breath like from running.</i>

00:06:39.230 --> 00:06:41.500
<i>The air's really getting thin.</i>

00:06:42.230 --> 00:06:43.570
Oh, that's right!

00:06:43.570 --> 00:06:44.500
Huh?

00:06:44.500 --> 00:06:47.950
Kaede-san was saying that 
we should take deep breaths.

00:06:47.950 --> 00:06:49.190
Deep breaths...

00:06:49.190 --> 00:06:50.010
Right!

00:06:57.040 --> 00:06:59.280
And also that it's good to whistle!

00:06:59.280 --> 00:07:00.140
Whistle?

00:07:29.420 --> 00:07:30.920
It's Hinata-chan.

00:07:31.880 --> 00:07:35.010
Good, I'm glad you made it there safely.

00:07:36.280 --> 00:07:36.900
Yeah.

00:07:38.890 --> 00:07:41.200
I'll take care of Aoi-chan.

00:07:41.200 --> 00:07:43.350
You eat and have a good rest.

00:07:43.350 --> 00:07:48.730
Mt. Fuji Hotel #1

00:07:43.780 --> 00:07:47.980
If she seems fine by midnight, 
we'll head up to the summit.

00:07:51.250 --> 00:07:53.420
How is Aoi-san?

00:07:53.420 --> 00:07:54.990
Kaede-san says not to worry.

00:07:54.990 --> 00:07:57.600
If Aoi gets better, they'll head up at midnight.

00:07:57.600 --> 00:07:59.250
I see...

00:07:59.250 --> 00:08:00.700
C'mon, let's eat!

00:08:00.700 --> 00:08:02.410
I'm starving!

00:08:02.610 --> 00:08:03.760
I am too!

00:08:03.760 --> 00:08:05.170
Time to eat!

00:08:08.340 --> 00:08:12.340
Mt. Fuji Hotel #1

00:08:08.450 --> 00:08:09.650
It's so good!

00:08:09.650 --> 00:08:11.810
It really is!

00:08:26.960 --> 00:08:27.980
Excuse me!

00:08:29.660 --> 00:08:30.870
Shh!

00:08:30.870 --> 00:08:32.900
Oh, s-sorry.

00:08:44.180 --> 00:08:46.500
Aren't we pushing it for 
making sunrise at the summit?

00:08:46.500 --> 00:08:47.870
And whose fault is that?

00:08:47.870 --> 00:08:48.670
Well, if we'd...

00:08:50.680 --> 00:08:52.120
Are you awake?

00:08:52.120 --> 00:08:53.850
What time is it now?

00:08:54.740 --> 00:08:56.340
Around two AM.

00:08:57.370 --> 00:08:58.450
Two AM...

00:08:58.450 --> 00:08:59.620
Let's go.

00:09:00.010 --> 00:09:04.810
Eighth Station - Crown Prince Inn
Elevation 3100 m

00:09:00.300 --> 00:09:01.750
If we don't hurry...

00:09:01.750 --> 00:09:03.210
we'll miss...

00:09:03.210 --> 00:09:04.810
the sunrise...

00:09:04.990 --> 00:09:06.960
Settle down, Aoi-chan!

00:09:06.960 --> 00:09:08.210
I have to go!

00:09:08.210 --> 00:09:09.060
Aoi-chan!

00:09:09.320 --> 00:09:10.600
Come on!

00:09:10.600 --> 00:09:12.980
I've made it this far already!

00:09:13.170 --> 00:09:14.890
If you overdo it going forward,

00:09:14.890 --> 00:09:16.650
what if you can't make it back?

00:09:19.000 --> 00:09:20.520
The mountain isn't going anywhere.

00:09:20.520 --> 00:09:23.100
You can tackle it as many times as you like.

00:09:23.100 --> 00:09:25.210
So, be patient. Okay?

00:09:27.000 --> 00:09:28.320
Brr!

00:09:28.320 --> 00:09:30.700
We should wear an extra layer.

00:09:30.700 --> 00:09:31.880
Right...

00:09:34.080 --> 00:09:35.660
What's that, Kokona-chan?

00:09:35.660 --> 00:09:36.780
Fleece.

00:09:36.780 --> 00:09:38.470
It's nice and warm!

00:09:39.590 --> 00:09:45.600
Mt. Fuji Hotel #1

00:09:40.750 --> 00:09:42.460
Now, we're all ready!

00:09:42.460 --> 00:09:44.490
Not to mention, all lumpy!

00:09:44.490 --> 00:09:45.600
Right!

00:09:45.600 --> 00:09:47.600
Mt. Fuji Hotel #2

00:09:49.650 --> 00:09:51.020
Hot Coffee
Hot Cocoa
Miso Soup
Sweet Sake
Sweet Bean Soup
Cup Ramen

00:09:49.650 --> 00:09:51.020
Joyful Conquest of the Summit

00:09:51.320 --> 00:09:52.400
Business cards!

00:09:52.400 --> 00:09:54.390
There are so many kinds of professions.

00:09:54.390 --> 00:09:56.370
Some are even from foreigners.

00:09:56.370 --> 00:09:57.780
It's amazing.

00:09:58.200 --> 00:10:00.740
They all climbed up this high.

00:10:03.060 --> 00:10:04.230
Hinata-san?

00:10:05.690 --> 00:10:07.240
It's from Kaede-san.

00:10:07.240 --> 00:10:09.530
She says, "Do your best on Aoi's behalf."

00:10:09.530 --> 00:10:10.920
I see...

00:10:11.710 --> 00:10:12.570
Let's go!

00:10:13.050 --> 00:10:14.960
We'll climb on Aoi's behalf!

00:10:20.930 --> 00:10:22.450
It's really dark out.

00:10:22.450 --> 00:10:24.330
Normally you'd be scared.

00:10:25.030 --> 00:10:27.880
<i>It's totally different 
from darkness in the city.</i>

00:10:28.260 --> 00:10:31.100
<i>This is how nighttime looks in nature.</i>

00:10:31.100 --> 00:10:32.400
Bathroom Collection Box
200 yen

00:10:40.930 --> 00:10:42.870
We took it too easy.

00:10:42.870 --> 00:10:44.370
What's wrong with that?

00:10:46.550 --> 00:10:48.260
Aoi-chan, look.

00:10:57.590 --> 00:10:59.160
It sure is pretty!

00:10:59.160 --> 00:11:00.150
Yeah!

00:11:00.150 --> 00:11:02.390
I hope Aoi-san is seeing this, too.

00:11:03.130 --> 00:11:04.200
Yeah, really.

00:11:05.250 --> 00:11:06.600
So that's...

00:11:06.600 --> 00:11:07.970
the Milky Way...

00:11:07.970 --> 00:11:13.980
Eighth Station

00:11:08.940 --> 00:11:11.670
<i>I'd wanted to see the Milky Way for so long,</i>

00:11:11.670 --> 00:11:13.980
<i>but it's different from what I imagined.</i>

00:11:14.650 --> 00:11:16.750
<i>It looks more like a stain.</i>

00:11:21.310 --> 00:11:22.960
<i>It's hard to breathe.</i>

00:11:22.960 --> 00:11:24.990
<i>But, I'm too excited</i>

00:11:25.620 --> 00:11:27.240
<i>to feel tired.</i>

00:11:29.840 --> 00:11:31.000
Hinata-san!

00:11:31.000 --> 00:11:31.870
Yeah?

00:11:32.680 --> 00:11:35.200
The sky's getting lighter.

00:11:35.200 --> 00:11:36.410
We'd better hurry!

00:11:36.410 --> 00:11:37.160
Right!

00:11:37.160 --> 00:11:38.630
Just one more push!

00:11:38.750 --> 00:11:39.680
Yeah!

00:11:39.680 --> 00:11:41.380
Now I'm even more excited!

00:11:42.290 --> 00:11:43.890
<i>Just a bit further.</i>

00:11:44.570 --> 00:11:45.940
<i>A bit further!</i>

00:11:48.510 --> 00:11:50.260
<i>I wish I was home.</i>

00:11:50.790 --> 00:11:55.230
<i>I want to sleep in a real bed, 
not a sleeping bag.</i>

00:11:55.230 --> 00:11:59.980
Eighth Station

00:11:57.020 --> 00:11:59.980
To Be Continued
